# Legibility Office Institutional Agents

## Purpose

This directory contains autonomous AI agents that implement the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS).

Unlike workflows, agents continuously observe, interpret, reason, and generate institutional intelligence.

They function as permanent institutional analysts rather than one-time automations.

---

## Agent Categories

### Institutional Intelligence

- Institutional Signal Agent
- Institutional Comment Agent
- Governance Review Agent
- Policy Monitor Agent

---

### Public Systems

- Procurement Intelligence Agent
- Procurement Risk Agent
- Digital Public Infrastructure Agent
- Capability Assessment Agent

---

### Knowledge Systems

- Institutional Memory Agent
- Research Agent
- DFI Intelligence Agent
- Civilization Intelligence Agent

---

### Coordination

- IOS Orchestrator Agent

---

## Design Principles

Every agent must

- Observe
- Classify
- Interpret
- Generate evidence
- Preserve institutional memory
- Produce explainable outputs

---

## Core Philosophy

Agents do not replace institutions.

Agents increase institutional legibility.

